   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Qing Mu Chuan Landscapes</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Traditional Village Landscapes: Values and Preservation (Qing Mu Chuan)\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of Yang, Qiu & Fu (2021), Sustainability 13:1171: rate nine photographs of the traditional village of Qing Mu Chuan, China (natural, agricultural and cultural scenes) on preference, four value perceptions and preservation willingness.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"scenes\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"intro\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part voluntarily and know I can stop at any time.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"respondent_group\",\n      \"title\": \"Which describes you best?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Native resident of Qing Mu Chuan\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Landscape professional (landscape architecture, planning or landscape ecology student, faculty member or designer)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Neither\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"scenes\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"custom\",\n      \"name\": \"scene_rating\",\n      \"title\": \"Rate each traditional village landscape scene\",\n      \"isRequired\": false,\n      \"description\": \"Nine photographs of Qing Mu Chuan (Shaanxi, China), shown one at a time in the order of the paper's Appendix A: natural (jinxi_river, forest_around_mountain, forest_narrow_road), agricultural (vegetable_land, corn_land) and cultural (hui_longchang_old_avenue, new_riverside_avenue, land_boat_house, stone_road). For each scene: preference, four value perceptions (daily utility, economic, recreational, cultural) and preservation willingness, each 1–5. Value: {preference, daily_utility, economic, recreational, cultural, preservation}. Analysis as in the paper: ANOVA with post-hoc tests across scenes, t-tests residents vs professionals, stepwise regression of preservation willingness on the four values.\",\n      \"items\": [\n       {\n        \"key\": \"preference\",\n        \"text\": \"How much do you like this landscape?\",\n        \"lo\": \"Not at all\",\n        \"hi\": \"Very much\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"key\": \"daily_utility\",\n        \"text\": \"This landscape is essential to daily life.\",\n        \"lo\": \"Not very highly\",\n        \"hi\": \"Very highly\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"key\": \"economic\",\n        \"text\": \"The landscape can create economic income in the future.\",\n        \"lo\": \"Not very highly\",\n        \"hi\": \"Very highly\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"key\": \"recreational\",\n        \"text\": \"The landscape has a recreational function, where I am relaxed.\",\n        \"lo\": \"Not very highly\",\n        \"hi\": \"Very highly\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"key\": \"cultural\",\n        \"text\": \"The landscape is a part of the traditional village heritage and has cultural significance.\",\n        \"lo\": \"Not very highly\",\n        \"hi\": \"Very highly\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"key\": \"preservation\",\n        \"text\": \"How willing are you to preserve this landscape?\",\n        \"lo\": \"Not willing at all\",\n        \"hi\": \"Very willing\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"trials\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"jinxi_river\",\n        \"label\": \"Jin Xi River\",\n        \"type\": \"natural\",\n        \"image\": \"jinxi_river.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"forest_around_mountain\",\n        \"label\": \"Forest around mountain\",\n        \"type\": \"natural\",\n        \"image\": \"forest_around_mountain.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"forest_narrow_road\",\n        \"label\": \"Forest with narrow road\",\n        \"type\": \"natural\",\n        \"image\": \"forest_narrow_road.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"vegetable_land\",\n        \"label\": \"Vegetable land\",\n        \"type\": \"agricultural\",\n        \"image\": \"vegetable_land.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"corn_land\",\n        \"label\": \"Corn land\",\n        \"type\": \"agricultural\",\n        \"image\": \"corn_land.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"hui_longchang_old_avenue\",\n        \"label\": \"Hui Longchang Old Avenue\",\n        \"type\": \"cultural\",\n        \"image\": \"hui_longchang_old_avenue.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"new_riverside_avenue\",\n        \"label\": \"New Riverside Avenue\",\n        \"type\": \"cultural\",\n        \"image\": \"new_riverside_avenue.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"land_boat_house\",\n        \"label\": \"Land boat house (Rong Shengkui)\",\n        \"type\": \"cultural\",\n        \"image\": \"land_boat_house.jpg\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"stone_road\",\n        \"label\": \"Stone road to Fu Ren high school\",\n        \"type\": \"cultural\",\n        \"image\": \"stone_road.jpg\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#eceee8;--card:#fff;--ink:#22261f;--muted:#5f675a;--accent:#7a3b2e;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#d9ddd2;--warn:#b3261e;--miss:#fdecea}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 10px}\np{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:18px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card)}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.pic{background:#e3e6df;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.pic img{width:100%;max-height:min(50vh,460px);object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.it{padding:10px 6px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}\n.it .x{font-weight:500;margin-bottom:6px}\n.sc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:4px}\n.sc label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;padding:2px 0}\n.sc input{width:20px;height:20px;margin:0 0 2px}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}\n.it.miss{background:var(--miss)}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs: Yang, Qiu &amp; Fu (2021), Sustainability 13:1171, Appendix A, doi:10.3390/su13031171 (CC BY 4.0; traditional village of Qing Mu Chuan, Shaanxi, China). Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='qingmuchuan2021:';\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, ans={}, TR=[], ITEMS=[], done={};\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e){e.textContent=m||'';e.style.visibility='visible';}}\n  function hideErr(){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.style.visibility='hidden';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function q(n){return Q[n]||{};}\n  function page(html,btn,cb){app.innerHTML=html+'<div style=\"margin-top:18px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn)+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;app.onchange=hideErr;}\n  function send(list,b,fin){b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}fin();});}\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!ans.intro)return intro();\n    if(!ans.about)return about();\n    for(var i=0;i<TR.length;i++)if(!done[TR[i].id])return scene(TR[i],i);\n    finish();\n  }\n  function intro(){\n    var miss=TR.some(function(t){return !files[t.image];});\n    if(miss){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder scenes must hold the nine landscape photographs (jinxi_river.jpg … stone_road.jpg).</p>';return;}\n    page('<h1>Landscapes of a traditional village</h1><p>You will see nine photographs of Qing Mu Chuan, a traditional village in Shaanxi, China: its river, forests, farmland and old streets. For each photograph, say how much you like it, what values it has, and how willing you are to preserve it.</p><p>It takes about 10 minutes. Your answers are anonymous and used only for research.</p><div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(q('consent').title)+'</label></div>','Start',function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Please confirm to continue.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){ans.intro=true;save('a',ans);next();});});\n  }\n  function about(){\n    var d=q('respondent_group');\n    page('<h1>About you</h1><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+'</b>'+(d.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"grp\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div></div>','Continue',function(){\n      var x=app.querySelector('input[name=grp]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please choose one answer.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('respondent_group',Number(x.value))],this,function(){ans.about=true;save('a',ans);next();});});\n  }\n  function scene(t,i){\n    var f=files[t.image];\n    var rows=ITEMS.map(function(it){return '<div class=\"it\" data-k=\"'+it.key+'\"><div class=\"x\">'+esc(it.text)+'</div><div class=\"sc\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"'+esc(it.text)+'\">'+[1,2,3,4,5].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+it.key+'\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"ends\"><span>1 = '+esc(it.lo)+'</span><span>5 = '+esc(it.hi)+'</span></div></div>';}).join('');\n    page('<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Scene '+(i+1)+' of '+TR.length+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*i/TR.length)+'%\"></i></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"'+esc(t.label)+', Qing Mu Chuan\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600\">'+esc(t.label)+'</p>'+rows+'</div>',i===TR.length-1?'Finish':'Next scene',function(){\n      var v={},miss=[];\n      ITEMS.forEach(function(it){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+it.key+'\"]:checked');var r=app.querySelector('.it[data-k=\"'+it.key+'\"]');if(x){v[it.key]=Number(x.value);r.classList.remove('miss');}else{miss.push(r);r.classList.add('miss');}});\n      if(miss.length){err(miss.length+' question'+(miss.length>1?'s are':' is')+' not answered yet (marked in red).');miss[0].scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return;}\n      send([SPSite.answer('scene_rating',v,{key:t.id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){done[t.id]=true;next();});});\n    app.onchange=function(e){hideErr();var r=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.it');if(r)r.classList.remove('miss');};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>In the original study, 91 native residents of Qing Mu Chuan and 60 landscape professionals rated these scenes. Both groups liked the Jin Xi River most. Residents valued the old buildings and streets highly and were most willing to preserve the land boat house, while professionals rated scenes lower overall. Farmland and forest scenes were liked least.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Photographs and method: Yang, H., Qiu, L., &amp; Fu, X. (2021). Toward Cultural Heritage Sustainability through Participatory Planning Based on Investigation of the Value Perceptions and Preservation Attitudes: Qing Mu Chuan, China. Sustainability 13:1171, doi:10.3390/su13031171.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){if(x==='consent')ans.intro=false;else if(x==='scene_rating')done={};else ans.about=false;});save('a',ans);next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    var SPEC;try{SPEC=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sp-scheme').textContent).survey;}catch(e){SPEC={pages:[]};}\n    SPEC.pages.forEach(function(p){p.elements.forEach(function(e){var g=SPSite.getQuestion(e.name)||{};Q[e.name]={title:g.title||e.title,choices:(g.choices&&g.choices.length)?g.choices:e.choices};if(e.name==='scene_rating'){TR=e.trials;ITEMS=e.items;}});});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('scenes')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name]=f;});\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};ans=load('a')||{};\n    ((a.scene_rating&&a.scene_rating.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    ans.intro=a.consent===true;ans.about=a.respondent_group!=null;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
